            "value" : "依引擎設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow engine uses the engine's declared selection keys — number keys when it declares none — switching to Shift + number keys when they would collide with a CIN table's roots. Number labels light up while Shift is held." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow engine uses the engine's declared selection keys — number keys when it declares none — switching to Shift + number keys when they would collide with a CIN table's roots. Number labels light up while Shift is held."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依引擎設定採用引擎宣告的選字鍵，未宣告時使用數字鍵；與 CIN 表格的字根衝突時自動改用 Shift + 數字鍵。數字標籤在按住 Shift 時亮起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications help you spot unexpected edits to an external engine's files. Change this later in the General settings tab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notifications help you spot unexpected edits to an external engine's files. Change this later in the General settings tab."
